| magma | `#6a2404` `#c24a06` `#f77a0a` `#fcb809` `#fcee09` `#fdfa92` |
| neon amber | `#c24a06` `#fc7a08` `#fcb809` `#fdf06a` `#fffbe0`, glow `#fc8a10` |
